// the tiles and must match it.
//
// Why: the arena is a bowl, about 75.7 at the centre rising to 77-77.6 at
// the shield ring (the shields spawn at z 76.73), while the plan used one
// flat z (75). Round 5: every destination near a shield was rejected by the
// movement planner (route_destination_path_control_level_gap: the path's
