// shield (311 rejections; the Searing Flame went ungonged), and the air kite's
// ring waypoints, the kite and the ranged arc near the rim failed too.
// Destinations now take this floor (within 0.5 yd of the navmesh inside the
// arena at 2 yd bilinear; the navmesh itself sits 0-0.7 yd above the vmap
// floor, inside the planner's 1.5 yd tolerance).
